<title>USA: Boeing Co Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Boeing Co Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	  Q4	    1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.96		    $0.63</p>
<p> Net			338,000		  218,000</p>
<p> Revs		   6,512,000		4,539,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 351,700		  343,400</p>
<p>					    YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.40		    $1.15</p>
<p> Net		    1,182,000		  393,000</p>
<p> Revs		  22,681,000	     19,515,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 347,800		  342,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 and year 1996 figures above exclude charges of $84 million and $87 million, respectively, for a ShareValue Trust established for employees. Including the charge, Q4 1996 net income was $254 million, or $0.75/shr, based on 340.5 million shrs outstanding. Including the charge, year 1996 net income was $1.095 bln, or $3.19/shr, based on 343.7 million shrs outstanding.</p>
<p>Q4 and year 1996 include sales and earnings from the acquired Rockwell aerospace and defense units after Dec. 6.</p>
<p>Year 1995 includes the effect of a $600 million pre-tax charge for a special retirement program.</p>
</text>
